Brand ai prompt library
title end

paragraph start
A prompt is stored with its purpose, its input, the rule for its output and one example. A prompt that works is kept, and a prompt that failed is kept with the reason.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Prompts never contain passwords, private data or follower personal data.
paragraph end

